                                                                                                                <comments>
                            <comment id="14591071" author="vkulichenko" created="Thu, 18 Jun 2015 01:09:26 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;Need to check other data structures as well and create tests.&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
                            <comment id="14619827" author="vkulichenko" created="Thu, 9 Jul 2015 03:36:07 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;Reviewed with Alex G.&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
                            <comment id="16249288" author="arunkjn" created="Mon, 13 Nov 2017 09:23:04 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;Hi &lt;a href=&quot;https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/ViewProfile.jspa?name=vkulichenko&quot; class=&quot;user-hover&quot; rel=&quot;vkulichenko&quot;&gt;vkulichenko&lt;/a&gt;,&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;I get the same behaviour with ignite 2.3. Maybe this is a regression? Or was it not fixed due to some reasons?&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
                            <comment id="16250508" author="vkulichenko" created="Mon, 13 Nov 2017 23:52:20 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/ViewProfile.jspa?name=arunkjn&quot; class=&quot;user-hover&quot; rel=&quot;arunkjn&quot;&gt;arunkjn&lt;/a&gt;, this particular code works fine for me. Do you have a test that fails?&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
                            <comment id="16250735" author="arunkjn" created="Tue, 14 Nov 2017 03:01:26 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;Hey &lt;a href=&quot;https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/ViewProfile.jspa?name=vkulichenko&quot; class=&quot;user-hover&quot; rel=&quot;vkulichenko&quot;&gt;vkulichenko&lt;/a&gt;, In my case the call &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;code panel&quot; style=&quot;border-width: 1px;&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;codeContent panelContent&quot;&gt;
&lt;pre class=&quot;code-java&quot;&gt;
IgniteQueue q = ignite.queue(&lt;span class=&quot;code-quote&quot;&gt;&quot;queue&quot;&lt;/span&gt;, 0, &lt;span class=&quot;code-keyword&quot;&gt;null&lt;/span&gt;);
&lt;/pre&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;does not fail, but the object returned by it is null. In this case &apos;q&apos; becomes null. I get NPE in the next statement where I use &apos;q&apos;.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;This has been discussed in ignite forum &lt;a href=&quot;http://apache-ignite-users.70518.x6.nabble.com/Use-IgniteQueue-in-client-td18133.html&quot; class=&quot;external-link&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot;&gt;here&lt;/a&gt; and Alexey has opened &lt;a href=&quot;https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/IGNITE-6889&quot; class=&quot;external-link&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow&quot;&gt;this&lt;/a&gt; issue to track.&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
